# Play test of the plan 'Relic of the Seventh Tide' (CIPlay plan_relic_seventh_tide, in a test world 'CI ...' set to day 5
# first with CISetDay 5, for Rope Bridge Gorge's day:5): Raft's
# story from its start with Raft's own notes read as the game does; Kett's islands come on the Receiver after their
# story islands (Sunstaff Mesa in Balboa's place), each played to its end with its own test, and lead on to the next -
# and the two side islands, sailed to. Colossus uses its body test: the gears are already in hand from the islands before.
plan Relic of the Seventh Tide
note RadioTower
expect chain RadioTower unlocked
expect chain museum locked

# The museum needs the Radio Tower done and 3 km sailed
sail 3
note Vasagatan
expect chain museum unlocked
tune museum
include marrow_key_museum.play
expect chain museum done
expect chain Vasagatan unlocked

# Sunstaff Mesa in Balboa's place: its chests hold Balboa's four blueprints
note Balboa
expect chain mesa unlocked
tune mesa
include sunstaff_mesa.play
expect chain mesa done

# Caravan Town done and the mesa reached: the necropolis
note Tangaroa
expect chain necro unlocked
tune necro
include sandsunk_necropolis.play
expect chain necro done

# Tangaroa's note: the mooring mast (done when its strongbox is open - step 5)
note VarunaPoint
expect chain mast unlocked
tune mast
include skyhook_mast.play
expect chain mast done

# Varuna Point's note: the Hollow Fang
note Temperance
expect chain fang unlocked
tune fang
include the_hollow_fang.play
expect chain fang done

# Temperance's note: the Colossus, then the Tide Engine, then Utopia - the end of Raft's story
note Utopia
expect chain colossus unlocked
tune colossus
include colossus_of_the_strait_body.play
expect chain colossus done
expect chain engine unlocked
tune engine
include the_tide_engine.play
expect chain engine done
expect chain Utopia unlocked

# The side islands: the dredging camp at 8 km (on the Receiver's sailing band), the gorge ahead (day 5)
sail 5
# (past 8 km the rule fires; by chance while sailing = 0.3 to 1.8 km further on)
sail 2
sail 2
arrive dredgers
include dredgers_bank.play
arrive gorge
include rope_bridge_gorge.play
expect blueprints
plan end
